{"id":"9e1e1a22b5758041","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-vitali-set.md","title":"Vitali Set","display":"df-vitali-set — Vitali Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-vitali-set","aliases":["58-df-vitali-set","Vitali Set"],"display":"df-vitali-set — Vitali Set","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-rational.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-vitali-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-vitali-set</span><span>Vitali Set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-vitali-set — Vitali Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"21c0965b79ed66aa\" href=\"?note=21c0965b79ed66aa\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-rational.md\">../batch13/58-df-rational.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in V\">\\(S\\in V\\)</span> (candidate selector; the letter is distinct from the ambient universe class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Q\">\\(\\mathbb Q\\)</span> (standard rational-number field; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"21c0965b79ed66aa\" href=\"?note=21c0965b79ed66aa\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-rational.md\">../batch13/58-df-rational.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VitaliSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{VitaliSet}_S\\)</span> (Vitali-selector predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}vitali\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{VitaliSet}_S(S)\\leftrightarrow S\\subseteq[0,1]\\land \\forall x\\in[0,1]\\;\\exists!s\\in S\\;(x-s\\in\\mathbb Q)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}vitali\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{VitaliSet}_S(S)\\leftrightarrow S\\subseteq[0,1]\\land \\forall x\\in[0,1]\\;\\exists!s\\in S\\;(x-s\\in\\mathbb Q)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Vitali set: selector of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{R}/\\mathbb{Q}\">\\(\\mathbb{R}/\\mathbb{Q}\\)</span> cosets; existence requires AC</li>\n<li>The translates <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S+q\">\\(S+q\\)</span> for distinct <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\in\\mathbb Q\\cap[-1,1]\">\\(q\\in\\mathbb Q\\cap[-1,1]\\)</span> are disjoint, and their union contains <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[0,1]\">\\([0,1]\\)</span>; non-measurability is a downstream theorem.</li>\n<li>Independence: ZF cannot prove existence or non-existence of Vitali sets</li>\n<li>Solovay: there is a model of ZF + DC where all sets of reals are Lebesgue measurable</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Vitali, Sul problema della misura dei punti di un insieme</li>\n<li>Solovay, A Model of Set Theory in which Every Set of Reals is Lebesgue Measurable</li>\n<li>Jech, Set Theory (Vitali set section)</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-rational.md","status":"resolved","id":"21c0965b79ed66aa","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-rational.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-rational.md","status":"resolved","id":"21c0965b79ed66aa","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbb Q$ (standard rational-number field; see [[../batch13/58-df-rational.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{VitaliSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}vitali\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{VitaliSet}_S(S)\\leftrightarrow S\\subseteq[0,1]\\land \\forall x\\in[0,1]\\;\\exists!s\\in S\\;(x-s\\in\\mathbb Q)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb{R}/\\mathbb{Q}","display":false},{"tex":"S+q","display":false},{"tex":"q\\in\\mathbb Q\\cap[-1,1]","display":false},{"tex":"[0,1]","display":false}],"bytes":1327,"backlinks":[{"id":"8107070d99d9c69c","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1369","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-vitali-set.md|58-df-vitali-set]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["21c0965b79ed66aa"]}